  "linksAbout": "Links have no frame: text (and an optional icon) in the button's label style for that size, no fill, no border, no padding. Colour changes per state.",
  "loading": "Disabled colours; the trailing icon becomes a spinner. The spinner is an icon: same frame, the ring fills the key square, line weight = frame \u00d7 size/icon/grid/stroke.",
  "focus": "Rest colours plus a ring outside the border: border/focus, stroke/2.",
  "effects": "Inner shade on every filled state, inset 0 -4 10 rgba(0,0,0,.5). An effect, not a token (D-021)."
